---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION, GITHUB_URL, LINKEDIN_URL, EMAIL } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`About - ${SITE_TITLE}`} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<div class="about-page">
				<h1>About Me</h1>
				<div class="about-content">
					<p>
						I'm Pavel Luzanov, a senior product engineer based in Tokyo, Japan. My
						selling point is simple: I get products to release by whatever means it
						takes. Frontend is my strongest craft, built over many years of pure
						frontend work: optimization, build systems, design kits.
					</p>
					<p>
						Today the work looks different. Pure frontend and pure backend roles are
						shrinking. What teams need is people who understand the domain, talk to the
						business, pull specifications out of vague requests, and orchestrate agent
						workflows. I want to do exactly that, and it is what I do.
					</p>
					<p>
						In the last year I have worked mostly on the backend side and on speed:
						performance, and making CI and delivery faster. I do not write backend code
						by hand. I am deep in it all the same, designing, reviewing and owning the
						result while agents do the typing.
					</p>
					<p>
						I will show how this works in a series of posts on the blog.
					</p>
					<h2>Writing</h2>
					<p>
						Engineering articles from 2021 and 2022 and recent notes on agent workflows live
						on the <a href="/blog">blog</a>.
					</p>
					<p>
						Feel free to reach out if you'd like to collaborate or talk about engineering.
					</p>
					<div class="contact-links">
						<a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`} class="btn btn-primary">Email Me</a>
						<a href={GITHUB_URL} class="btn btn-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
						<a href={LINKEDIN_URL} class="btn btn-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.about-page {
		max-width: 700px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2rem 1rem;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.about-content {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
	}

	.about-content p {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	h2 {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
	}

	.contact-links {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1rem;
		justify-content: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}

</style>
